<item>
            <title>[LU-20940] dkms: BUILD_DEPENDS misses mlnx-ofa_kernel (DOCA on EL)</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20940</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Since DOCA 3.2.0, the EL packages ship the OFED kernel modules as the DKMS module &lt;tt&gt;mlnx-ofa&lt;font color=&quot;#de350b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;_&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;kernel&lt;/tt&gt; (&lt;tt&gt;mlnx-ofa_kernel-dkms&lt;/tt&gt; RPM) instead of kmod RPMs. &lt;tt&gt;dkms.mkconf&lt;/tt&gt; adds only the Debian name &lt;tt&gt;mlnx-ofed&lt;font color=&quot;#de350b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;-&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;kernel&lt;/tt&gt; to BUILD_DEPENDS (&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19553&quot; title=&quot;DKMS: add depends for additional packages lustre may depend upon&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;LU-19553&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-19553&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;), so on a kernel update DKMS may build Lustre before the OFED modules for that kernel.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment>DKMS with DOCA &amp;gt;= 3.2.0</environment>
        <key id="99792">LU-20940</key>
